railroad-kit-pistol-name = 10mm pistol kit
railroad-kit-pistol-description = A cheap, common sidearm that won't draw attention. Contains 1 loaded 10mm pistol, 2 spare 10mm magazines, a combat knife, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-doublebarrel-name = Double-barrel shotgun kit
railroad-kit-doublebarrel-description = A farmer's shotgun nobody looks at twice. Contains 1 double-barrel shotgun, 1 box of 12-gauge shells, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-medic-name = Safehouse medic kit
railroad-kit-medic-description = Patch up runaways and wounded agents. Contains 1 stocked medical belt, 1 compact defibrillator, a health scanner, a folded body bag, 1 blood pack, a CPR training manual, a surgical duffel bag stocked with surgical tools, a bottle of ethanol, sterile latex gloves, a sterile mask, and 1 MRE kit.
railroad-kit-smg-name = 10mm SMG kit
railroad-kit-smg-description = Fast, light firepower for smuggling runs. Contains 1 loaded 10mm SMG, 2 spare 10mm SMG magazines, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-suppressedsmg-name = Suppressed SMG kit
railroad-kit-suppressedsmg-description = Quiet work for quiet people. Contains 1 loaded 10mm suppressed SMG, 2 spare 10mm SMG magazines, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-tech-name = Tech kit
railroad-kit-tech-description = Tools for bypassing locks, rewiring terminals and keeping safehouse gear running. Contains 1 stocked utility belt, a multitool, a remote signaller, a flashlight, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-laser-name = AER-9 laser rifle kit
railroad-kit-laser-description = A reliable pre-war laser rifle. Contains 1 AER-9 laser rifle with a loaded microfusion cell, 2 spare microfusion cells, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-combatshotgun-name = Combat shotgun kit
railroad-kit-combatshotgun-description = For when the extraction goes loud. Contains 1 loaded combat shotgun, 1 spare shotgun magazine, 1 box of 12-gauge shells, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-greasegun-name = Grease gun kit
railroad-kit-greasegun-description = Old, ugly and dependable. Contains 1 loaded M3A1 grease gun, 2 spare .45 SMG magazines, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-smg12mm-name = 12.7mm SMG kit
railroad-kit-smg12mm-description = Heavy-hitting submachine gun for safehouse owners. Contains 1 loaded 12.7mm SMG, 2 spare 12.7mm SMG magazines, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-infiltrator-name = Infiltrator kit
railroad-kit-infiltrator-description = A compact, quiet SMG for inspecting safehouses unannounced. Contains 1 loaded infiltrator SMG, 2 spare 9mm SMG magazines, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-lmg-name = Bren gun kit
railroad-kit-lmg-description = The Railroad's only machine gun, kept for the Alpha Leader. Contains 1 loaded Bren machine gun, 2 spare .308 Bren magazines, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
railroad-kit-aer12-name = AER-12 laser rifle kit
railroad-kit-aer12-description = A rare automatic laser rifle. Contains 1 AER-12 laser rifle with a loaded microfusion cell, 3 spare microfusion cells, 1 MRE kit, 1 stimpak, and 1 roll of clean gauze (10 uses).
